# Adrenaline Jockey: "Whenever you activate an exhaust ability, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature." Bot1 casts the Jockey on turn 1
# (3/3). On turn 3 it casts a Hog-Monkey (Black Lotus) and pays its "Exhaust - {5}" with five Moxen: the activation puts a counter on the
# Jockey (4/4, one counter; before it, casting the Monkey and tapping mana left it 3/3) and the Monkey gets its own two (5/4).

